From 03dce9fd597e79ab9be777416b9d6b2f42bcdda7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sylvestre Ledru <sylvestre@debian.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 23:11:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] preprocessor cache: stat each include once on lookup

result_matches already takes the symlink_metadata of each include to check
its size, and the digest cache then stat-ed the same path again. Unless the
include is a symlink, that first stat describes the file itself, so pass it
down instead.

Server CPU per direct-mode cache hit (perf stat, 200 hits):
  C:                    0.43 ms -> 0.39 ms
  C++ (STL headers):    0.89 ms -> 0.72 ms

Signed-off-by: Javier Tia <javier@peridio.com>
